//   score     = 1 - raw_bias_score
//   threshold = 1 - deepeval_native_threshold   (read at runtime; default 0.5)
// raw_bias_score + reason are carried verbatim for provenance. The harness
// reports the REAL pass-rate — never tuned to hit a target.
//
